    <chapter>
      <heading>
        Software documentation for the TTIOBamReaderAdapter
        class
      </heading>
      <class name="TTIOBamReaderAdapter" super="NSObject">
        <declared>TTIOReaderAdapters.h</declared>
        <conform>TTIOReader</conform>
        <desc>
          BAM adapter. opts: <code>name</code> (default
          <code>genomic_0001</code>), <code>region</code>,
          <code>sample</code>.
        </desc>
      </class>
    </chapter>
    <chapter>
      <heading>
        Software documentation for the TTIOBrukerReaderAdapter
        class
      </heading>
      <class name="TTIOBrukerReaderAdapter" super="NSObject">
        <declared>TTIOReaderAdapters.h</declared>
        <conform>TTIOReader</conform>
        <desc>
          Bruker timsTOF <code>.d</code> adapter. opts: none.
        </desc>
      </class>
    </chapter>
    <chapter>
      <heading>
        Software documentation for the TTIOCramReaderAdapter
        class
      </heading>
      <class name="TTIOCramReaderAdapter" super="NSObject">
        <declared>TTIOReaderAdapters.h</declared>
        <conform>TTIOReader</conform>
        <desc>
          CRAM adapter. Requires <code>reference</code> (reference
          FASTA); same <code>name</code> / <code>region</code>
          / <code>sample</code> opts as the BAM adapter.
        </desc>
      </class>
    </chapter>
    <chapter>
      <heading>
        Software documentation for the TTIOImzMLReaderAdapter
        class
      </heading>
      <class name="TTIOImzMLReaderAdapter" super="NSObject">
        <declared>TTIOReaderAdapters.h</declared>
        <conform>TTIOReader</conform>
        <desc>
          imzML adapter. opts: <code>ibd</code> (path to the
          <code>.ibd</code>; else <code>inputs[1]</code>; else
          sibling). Continuous mode only.
        </desc>
      </class>
    </chapter>
